{"_id":"drafts.article-agente-qa-mcp-chrome","_type":"article","title":"Cómo creé un agente de QA que prueba solo mis cambios en Chrome con MCP","slug":{"_type":"slug","current":"agente-qa-mcp-chrome"},"description":"Un agente de Claude Code que lee mi git diff, abre en Chrome solo las vistas afectadas y comprueba que el cambio se ve y funciona, sin recorrer todo el sitio.","publishedAt":"2026-10-14T05:43:01.417Z","body":[{"_type":"block","_key":"c4579231373d","style":"normal","children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"50505857fe30","text":"Mi web está hecha con una cadena de agentes: uno diseña, otro arma la arquitectura, otro construye las tareas y un ","marks":[]},{"_type":"span","_key":"4a43530b6bed","text":"reviewer","marks":["code"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"cb5826d3eae6","text":" revisa el código de cada una. Todo pasa por comandos: ","marks":[]},{"_type":"span","_key":"220ec032daec","text":"pnpm typecheck","marks":["code"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"3800dfcd8704","text":", ","marks":[]},{"_type":"span","_key":"f646c37afd24","text":"pnpm lint","marks":["code"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"d5402c894718","text":", ","marks":[]},{"_type":"span","_key":"c1a430794d02","text":"pnpm build","marks":["code"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"2e24ffdd48e2","text":", ","marks":[]},{"_type":"span","_key":"25d29d27abf3","text":"pnpm test","marks":["code"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"553304cfe527","text":". Y aun así, con todo en verde, me faltaba algo: nadie miraba la página justo después de cada cambio, como la mira un visitante.","marks":[]}],"markDefs":[]},{"_type":"block","_key":"403cb40da77d","style":"normal","children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b799aa213a4c","text":"Los comandos leen el código. El navegador muestra el resultado. Un enlace a ","marks":[]},{"_type":"span","_key":"8c180e92c2d4","text":"#stack","marks":["code"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"24ee8ad0700d","text":" que funciona en la portada y se rompe desde ","marks":[]},{"_type":"span","_key":"4cc01b04fb5c","text":"/blog","marks":["code"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"af5d120f662d","text":", una clave de traducción que no existe, un error de hidratación o un desborde horizontal a 390 px no los ve ningún test unitario. Para eso armé un agente de QA que prueba en Chrome solo lo que acabo de cambiar.","marks":[]}],"markDefs":[]},{"_type":"block","_key":"e027877b5c3d","style":"h2","children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"d0bef60d637e","text":"La idea: probar el cambio, no el sitio","marks":[]}],"markDefs":[]},{"_type":"block","_key":"63f0c581c7fb","style":"normal","children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"15817c2b34f1","text":"Recorrer todo el sitio en cada cambio es lento y caro. Casi siempre toco una sección, un componente o un texto. El agente parte de ahí:","marks":[]}],"markDefs":[]},{"_type":"block","_key":"b780df82b526","style":"normal","listItem":"bullet","level":1,"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"2cddba1671a5","text":"Lee mi ","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"9bc2dd706640","text":"git diff","marks":["strong","code"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"6731d4b9b8de","text":" para saber qué cambió.","marks":[]}],"markDefs":[]},{"_type":"block","_key":"1160eda32a67","style":"normal","listItem":"bullet","level":1,"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"496ea3c7f9a9","text":"Decide el alcance","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"7d0a0271cab1","text":" según la carpeta.","marks":[]}],"markDefs":[]},{"_type":"block","_key":"4360f2bc67bb","style":"normal","listItem":"bullet","level":1,"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"6a887ae7fcc6","text":"Abre en Chrome solo las vistas afectadas","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"41f69480cdd2","text":" y comprueba que el cambio se ve y funciona.","marks":[]}],"markDefs":[]},{"_type":"block","_key":"26ca4970d3bb","style":"normal","listItem":"bullet","level":1,"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"2e0d5433fcb2","text":"Me devuelve un informe corto","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"88ad2c78be10","text":", con evidencia y el archivo sospechoso si algo falla. No modifica código.","marks":[]}],"markDefs":[]},{"_type":"block","_key":"c56c1c7e0e41","style":"h2","children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"8bd8564f8000","text":"Las piezas","marks":[]}],"markDefs":[]},{"_type":"block","_key":"ad4fa83db90c","style":"normal","children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"7dbfa519af1c","text":"Son tres archivos, todos dentro del repositorio:","marks":[]}],"markDefs":[]},{"_type":"block","_key":"aa96c681e311","style":"normal","listItem":"bullet","level":1,"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"9fe59265c6af","text":".mcp.json","marks":["strong","code"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"a5894f278cae","text":":","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"3b0d13ec8824","text":" la conexión con Chrome DevTools MCP.","marks":[]}],"markDefs":[]},{"_type":"block","_key":"b793d968de8d","style":"normal","listItem":"bullet","level":1,"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"7e059b3f947b","text":".claude/agents/qa-changes.md","marks":["strong","code"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"f3724c16b230","text":":","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"01dc175ef95a","text":" el agente.","marks":[]}],"markDefs":[]},{"_type":"block","_key":"a84fe7a192e1","style":"normal","listItem":"bullet","level":1,"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"631e06ec42e4","text":".claude/commands/qa-changes.md","marks":["strong","code"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"f7e581e7cda2","text":":","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"5ba9579d049f","text":" un comando para lanzarlo con contexto, por ejemplo ","marks":[]},{"_type":"span","_key":"583e48375634","text":"/qa-changes blog","marks":["code"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"d48fb0ce3a7a","text":" o ","marks":[]},{"_type":"span","_key":"33b3a061fc65","text":"/qa-changes http://localhost:3000/blog","marks":["code"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"e68edd1ce117","text":".","marks":[]}],"markDefs":[]},{"_type":"block","_key":"6e19043de9f7","style":"h2","children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"0aa1f1ff722d","text":"Chrome con un perfil dedicado","marks":[]}],"markDefs":[]},{"_type":"block","_key":"57147cd081aa","style":"normal","children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"86a94ae6ee3d","text":"No conecto el agente a mi Chrome personal. Abro un Chrome aparte, con su propio perfil y el puerto de depuración activado:","marks":[]}],"markDefs":[]},{"_type":"block","_key":"6d404285c174","style":"normal","children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"cd67a8ec491b","text":"open -na \"Google Chrome\" --args --remote-debugging-port=9222 --user-data-dir=\"$HOME/chrome-qa\"","marks":["code"]}],"markDefs":[]},{"_type":"block","_key":"4b23cce86e45","style":"normal","children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"16037b6dc83a","text":"Chrome exige un perfil distinto del habitual para abrir ese puerto, y eso me viene bien: el agente no ve mis pestañas, mi correo ni mis sesiones. Si el proyecto tuviera login, ese perfil lo conservaría entre pruebas.","marks":[]}],"markDefs":[]},{"_type":"block","_key":"8761a6cf20f9","style":"normal","children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"c4f51005c866","text":"Después registro el servidor MCP en el proyecto, apuntando a ese Chrome:","marks":[]}],"markDefs":[]},{"_type":"block","_key":"d01ff2e624db","style":"normal","children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"499b98c98aca","text":"claude mcp add chrome --scope project -- npx chrome-devtools-mcp@latest --browserUrl=http://127.0.0.1:9222 --categoryMemory=false --categoryPerformance=false --screenshotFormat=jpeg --screenshotMaxWidth=1024","marks":["code"]}],"markDefs":[]},{"_type":"block","_key":"2eb3a409eec4","style":"normal","children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"88f31355aad8","text":"Con ","marks":[]},{"_type":"span","_key":"5083e331c8cf","text":"--scope project","marks":["code"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"2a41310c6ba3","text":" la configuración queda en ","marks":[]},{"_type":"span","_key":"92324c4578f4","text":".mcp.json","marks":["code"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"870d0bd7b288","text":", en el repositorio. Las categorías de memoria y rendimiento van apagadas porque este agente no las usa y cada herramienta cargada ocupa contexto. Una advertencia: mientras el puerto está abierto, cualquier programa de mi equipo puede controlar ese Chrome. Por eso es un perfil solo para pruebas y lo cierro al terminar.","marks":[]}],"markDefs":[]},{"_type":"block","_key":"82b8e67298a0","style":"h2","children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"d694a5882040","text":"El flujo del agente","marks":[]}],"markDefs":[]},{"_type":"block","_key":"347efe2dc916","style":"normal","children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"fef11d9a3b7e","text":"Paso 0: ¿ya estoy en la pantalla?","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"3e9a4ad422b9","text":" Si tengo abierta la vista que quiero probar, el agente usa esa pestaña tal como está, sin navegar ni recargar, para no perder el estado. Si necesita recargar (por ejemplo, para ver las peticiones de red desde el inicio), me pide permiso.","marks":[]}],"markDefs":[]},{"_type":"block","_key":"007e66c4b365","style":"normal","children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"aae7000efe4d","text":"Paso 1: alcance.","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"ad61bf4b98d7","text":" Lee ","marks":[]},{"_type":"span","_key":"e525f61e11ad","text":"git diff","marks":["code"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"7b6ec4a25851","text":" y decide según la carpeta:","marks":[]}],"markDefs":[]},{"_type":"block","_key":"3b814b2adaa7","style":"normal","listItem":"bullet","level":1,"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"a536a09180d1","text":"Un módulo","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"4a4b476da103","text":" (","marks":[]},{"_type":"span","_key":"a543a13c597d","text":"src/modules/home/","marks":["code"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"da430ddfa680","text":" o ","marks":[]},{"_type":"span","_key":"c14087cd4538","text":"src/modules/blog/","marks":["code"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"17ba8306fa6b","text":"): prueba solo las rutas de ese módulo.","marks":[]}],"markDefs":[]},{"_type":"block","_key":"4118df4da67d","style":"normal","listItem":"bullet","level":1,"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"c7550eef4cd7","text":"Piezas globales","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"a8575122757c","text":" (","marks":[]},{"_type":"span","_key":"87fe35d9438e","text":"AppHeader","marks":["code"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"8fbd73628982","text":", ","marks":[]},{"_type":"span","_key":"0d1df9418651","text":"AppFooter","marks":["code"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"1199530eec3a","text":", ","marks":[]},{"_type":"span","_key":"5c4748a82c54","text":"src/shared/seo/","marks":["code"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"5ff213c39658","text":", ","marks":[]},{"_type":"span","_key":"eb16bd505928","text":"layout.tsx","marks":["code"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"11031e9b153f","text":", ","marks":[]},{"_type":"span","_key":"3802064d9f0f","text":"theme.css","marks":["code"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"bf328839eefc","text":"): el impacto es de todo el sitio, así que propone una o dos vistas representativas, la portada y ","marks":[]},{"_type":"span","_key":"e5c117110088","text":"/blog","marks":["code"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"53a51df979da","text":".","marks":[]}],"markDefs":[]},{"_type":"block","_key":"331f00e904ae","style":"normal","listItem":"bullet","level":1,"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"98d3cb880d69","text":"Otras piezas de ","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"f4d0c3982760","text":"shared/","marks":["strong","code"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"95d3126b85d7","text":", como un wrapper ","marks":[]},{"_type":"span","_key":"59e0459fb64f","text":"Ui*","marks":["code"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"61e3a761b19b","text":": busca con ","marks":[]},{"_type":"span","_key":"277a952eb4b5","text":"grep","marks":["code"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"f8aaeae4a151","text":" qué módulos lo usan y me pregunta cuáles probar.","marks":[]}],"markDefs":[]},{"_type":"block","_key":"f0a1e1079b72","style":"normal","children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"a410ab4744a5","text":"Paso 2: rastreo.","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"17bbd923ef97","text":" Saca las URLs de las rutas del módulo y sigue la cadena que define mi proyecto: types → content → locales → compone